  checkpoint {
    session_summary: "<summary>\n1. **Task Overview**\n   - **User Request**:\n     1. Remove dashed outline bounding boxes / hint fields where the iPhone sits (at the start of animation in Hero and end of animation in Mantle).\n     2. Make all scroll animations re-trigger every time the user scrolls to them (`viewport={{ once: false }}` instead of `once: true`).\n     3. Use *only* real, existing servers from the official site/API, without invented ones, and remove excess empty space above servers in the \"\320\224\320\276\321\201\321\202\321\203\320\277\320\275\320\276\321\201\321\202\321\214\" section.\n     4. Regional pricing: If CIS/RU, show only 1 option: `199 \342\202\275 / \320\274\320\265\321\201\321\217\321\206`. If international/global, show 4 options:\n        - 1 month: `$3.49`\n        - 3 months: `$9.99` (\342\210\2223%)\n        - 6 months: `$18.99` (\342\210\2225%)\n        - 12 months: `$36.99` (\342\210\22210%)\n     5. Fix Mantle step 02 card tag so `02 / 03` never line-breaks/wraps onto two lines (`whitespace-nowrap shrink-0`).\n     6. Dynamic navbar scroll spy: highlight the currently viewed section in yellow (`#FDE047`), matching how \"\320\223\320\273\320\260\320\262\320\275\320\260\321\217\" was highlighted.\n   - **Scope Boundaries**: Dark mode (`#111111` bg, `#1A1A1A` cards, `#2A2A2A` borders, `#FDE047` accent). Single 3D volumetric iPhone flying along a parabolic arc behind `#platforms` and docking into `#mantle`.\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed in this turn**:\n     - `src/data/vpnData.ts`: Updated to store exactly the 8 verified production servers from `https://anke.dev/vnp/ru/servers` (`\320\223\320\265\321\200\320\274\320\260\320\275\320\270\321\217 \302\267 \320\235\321\216\321\200\320\275\320\261\320\265\321\200\320\263`, `\320\244\320\270\320\275\320\273\321\217\320\275\320\264\320\270\321\217 \302\267 \320\245\320\265\320\273\321\214\321\201\320\270\320\275\320\272\320\270`, `\320\237\320\276\320\273\321\214\321\210\320\260 \302\267 \320\222\320\260\321\200\321\210\320\260\320\262\320\260`, `\320\235\320\270\320\264\320\265\321\200\320\273\320\260\320\275\320\264\321\213 \302\267 \320\220\320\274\321\201\321\202\320\265\321\200\320\264\320\260\320\274`, `\320\230\321\200\320\273\320\260\320\275\320\264\320\270\321\217 \302\267 \320\224\321\203\320\261\320\273\320\270\320\275`, `\320\220\320\273\320\261\320\260\320\275\320\270\321\217 \302\267 \320\242\320\270\321\200\320\260\320\275\320\260 (YouTube \320\261\320\265\320\267 \321\200\320\265\320\272\320\273\320\260\320\274\321\213)`, `\320\241\320\250\320\220 \302\267 \320\247\320\270\320\272\320\260\320\263\320\276`, `\320\223\320\276\320\275\320\272\320\276\320\275\320\263 \302\267 \320\223\320\276\320\275\320\272\320\276\320\275\320\263`). Added `CIS_PRICING_TERMS` (`199 \342\202\275 / \320\274\320\265\321\201\321\217\321\206`) and `GLOBAL_PRICING_TERMS` (`$3.49`, `$9.99`, `$18.99`, `$36.99`).\n     - `src/components/PricingSection.tsx`: Created interactive regional pricing switcher (`\320\241\320\235\320\223 (\320\240\321\203\320\261\320\273\320\270)` vs `\320\230\320\275\320\276\321\201\321\202\321\200\320\260\320\275\320\275\321\213\320\265 \320\277\320\276\320\273\321\214\320\267\320\276\320\262\320\260\321\202\320\265\320\273\320\270 (USD)`), configured `199 \342\202\275 / \320\274\320\265\321\201\321\217\321\206` for CIS and the 4 tier cards for Global. Changed all `viewport={{ once: true }}` to `viewport={{ once: false }}`.\n     - `src/components/BentoFeatures.tsx`: Replaced server list with exact 8 official servers, removed excess top padding (`p-6 sm:p-7 flex flex-col justify-start`, `mb-4`, `gap-2` instead of huge empty spacing), changed all `viewport={{ once: true }}` to `viewport={{ once: false }}`.\n     - `src/components/Navbar.tsx`: Added `activeSection: string` prop and dynamic highlighting for all links (`#top`, `#platforms`, `#mantle`, `#features`, `#pricing`, `#support`).\n     - `src/components/PlatformCards.tsx`: Changed all `viewport={{ once: true }}` to `viewport={{ once: false }}`.\n     - `src/components/IPhone3DModel.tsx`: Fixed default selected server to `fi-hel` (Helsinki).\n   - **In Progress / Ready to Edit Next**:\n     - `src/components/HeroMantleChoreography.tsx`:\n       - Remove dashed svg rect in Hero (`lines 363-380`).\n       - Remove dashed landing dock ring in Mantle (`lines 486-493`).\n       - In step tags, add `whitespace-nowrap shrink-0` to the `02 / 03` counter span (`line 464`).\n       - Change remaining `viewport={{ once: true }}` to `viewport={{ once: false }}` (especially in Mantle benchmarks and section headers).\n     - `src/App.tsx`:\n       - Add scroll spy listener / IntersectionObserver across sections (`top`, `platforms`, `mantle`, `features`, `pricing`, `support`) and pass `activeSection` down to `<Navbar activeSection={activeSection} />`.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - The official production server list from `anke.dev/vnp/ru/servers` consists of exactly 8 servers: Germany (Nuremberg), Finland (Helsinki), Poland (Warsaw), Netherlands (Amsterdam), Ireland (Dublin), Albania (Tirana with YouTube ad-free tag), USA (Chicago), Hong Kong (Hong Kong). Icons for all 8 exist in `/public/countries/*.png`.\n   - The dashed outlines the user wants removed are:\n     1. `<svg className=\"...\"><rect strokeDasharray=\"6 6\" ... /></svg>` in the Hero anchor (`HeroMantleChoreography.tsx`).\n     2. `<div className=\"... border border-dashed ...\">` in the Mantle anchor (`HeroMantleChoreography.tsx`).\n   - The badge `02 / 03` wraps when the heading takes full flex width; adding `whitespace-nowrap shrink-0` to the badge and `flex-1 min-w-0` to the heading guarantees clean single-line display.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - No build or runtime errors. Previous builds and lints compiled with code 0 (`tsc --noEmit`).\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - Node/Vite development server on port 3000.\n   - Tailwind v4 configured in `src/index.css`.\n   - Motion (`motion/react`) for animation.\n\n6. **Next Steps**\n   1. **Edit `src/components/HeroMantleChoreography.tsx`**:\n      - Remove the dashed trajectory svg rect in Hero.\n      - Remove the dashed landing dock ring in Mantle.\n      - Add `whitespace-nowrap shrink-0` to the step number badge `<span>{step.num} / 03</span>`.\n      - Update all remaining `viewport={{ once: true }}` instances to `viewport={{ once: false }}`.\n   2. **Edit `src/App.tsx`**:\n      - Implement an active section scroll spy tracking `#top`, `#platforms`, `#mantle`, `#features`, `#pricing`, `#support`.\n      - Pass `activeSection` state to `<Navbar activeSection={activeSection} />`.\n   3. **Verify Build**:\n      - Run `compile_applet` and `lint_applet` concurrently to verify 0 syntax or type errors.\n\n7. **Commitments & Constraints**\n   - No mock data or invented servers; stick strictly to the 8 official servers.\n   - Strict dark mode palette (`#111111`, `#1A1A1A`, `#2A2A2A`, `#FDE047`).\n   - Tactile buttons (`active:scale-[0.98]`).\n</summary>"
