  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Structuring the Content**\n\nI\'ve been mapping out the page\'s core sections: a hero section at the top, followed by platform download cards. I\342\200\231m thinking next about integrating the Mantle section and then diving into the server features and Bento grid within the `BentoFeatures.tsx` file. After that, I will tackle the pricing options and conclude with support channels.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_6194880775574247838"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false,\"Description\":\"Remove dashed hint box in Hero, remove dashed dock ring in Mantle, make step tag whitespace-nowrap shrink-0, and make all animations trigger on each scroll (once: false)\",\"EndLine\":640,\"Instruction\":\"Remove dashed guides, ensure 02/03 doesn\'t wrap, and set once: false for all benchmarks and cards\",\"ReplacementContent\":\"            {/* Right Column: Hero Launch Anchor Slot for the Single 3D iPhone */}\\n            <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-5 xl:col-span-4 relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end\\\">\\n              {/* Exact Bounding Box Anchor for Hero iPhone Start Position */}\\n              <div\\n                ref={heroSlotRef}\\n                className=\\\"w-[300px] sm:w-[320px] h-[635px] shrink-0\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* =====================================================================\\n          SECTION 2: PLATFORMS (\\\"\320\224\320\276\321\201\321\202\321\203\320\277\320\275\320\276 \320\275\320\260 \320\262\321\201\320\265\321\205 \321\203\321\201\321\202\321\200\320\276\320\271\321\201\321\202\320\262\320\260\321\205\\\") \342\200\224 z-30!\\n          The z-20 3D iPhone physically passes UNDERNEATH this section!\\n         ===================================================================== */}\\n      <PlatformCards />\\n\\n      {/* =====================================================================\\n          SECTION 3: MANTLE CORE STICKY PIN TRACK & BENCHMARKS (z-10)\\n         ===================================================================== */}\\n      <section id=\\\"mantle\\\" className=\\\"relative z-10 border-b border-[#2A2A2A]\\\">\\n        {/* Tall Sticky Track (320vh) \342\200\224 locks scroll while stepping through 01, 02, 03 */}\\n        <div ref={mantleTrackRef} className=\\\"relative h-[320vh]\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"sticky top-[64px] min-h-[calc(100dvh-64px)] flex items-center py-10 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-4 sm:px-6\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center\\\">\\n                {/* Left Column: Header + Pinned Scroll Progress + Steps 01, 02, 03 */}\\n                <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-6\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"mb-8\\\">\\n                    <h2\\n                      style={{ fontSize: \'clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3.25rem)\' }}\\n                      className=\\\"font-bold tracking-tight text-[#FAFAFA] leading-[1.08]\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Mantle \342\200\224 \321\217\320\264\321\200\320\276 <span className=\\\"text-[#FDE047]\\\">Anke</span>\\n                    </h2>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-2.5 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#A1A1AA]\\\">\\n                      \320\235\320\265 VLESS \320\270 \320\275\320\265 \320\263\320\276\321\202\320\276\320\262\320\260\321\217 \321\201\320\261\320\276\321\200\320\272\320\260 \342\200\224 \321\201\320\262\320\276\321\221 \321\217\320\264\321\200\320\276, \320\275\320\260\320\277\320\270\321\201\320\260\320\275\320\275\320\276\320\265 \321\201 \320\275\321\203\320\273\321\217\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Steps List with Continuous Scroll Progress Bar */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative pl-5 space-y-3.5\\\">\\n                    {/* Vertical Track Line */}\\n                    <div\\n                      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"absolute left-0 top-2 bottom-2 w-1 rounded-full bg-[#2A2A2A] overflow-hidden\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <div\\n                        style={{ height: `${Math.round(pinProgress * 100)}%` }}\\n                        className=\\\"w-full bg-[#FDE047] shadow-[0_0_12px_#FDE047] transition-all duration-75\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {steps.map((step, idx) => {\\n                      const isActive = activeStepIndex === idx;\\n                      return (\\n                        <button\\n                          key={step.tab}\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => handleJumpToStep(idx, step.tab)}\\n                          className=\\\"w-full text-left cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#FDE047]\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <SpotlightShell\\n                            className={`transition-all duration-300 ${\\n                              isActive\\n                                ? \'border-[#FDE047] shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(253,224,71,0.12)] translate-x-1\'\\n                                : \'opacity-60 hover:opacity-90 hover:border-[#FAFAFA]/25\'\\n                            }`}\\n                            innerClassName={`p-5 sm:p-6 transition-colors ${\\n                              isActive\\n                                ? \'bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FDE047]/[0.08] to-transparent\'\\n                                : \'\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n                              <h3\\n                                className={`text-base sm:text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors flex-1 min-w-0 ${\\n                                  isActive ? \'text-[#FDE047]\' : \'text-[#FAFAFA]\'\\n                                }`}\\n                              >\\n                                {step.title}\\n                              </h3>\\n                              <span\\n                                className={`text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-md whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 ${\\n                                  isActive\\n                                    ? \'bg-[#FDE047] text-black font-bold\'\\n                                    : \'bg-[#222226] text-[#A1A1AA]\'\\n                                }`}\\n                              >\\n                                {step.num} / 03\\n                              </span>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#A1A1AA] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                              {step.desc}\\n                            </p>\\n                          </SpotlightShell>\\n                        </button>\\n                      );\\n                    })}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Right Column: Mantle Landing Anchor Slot for the Single 3D iPhone */}\\n                <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-6 relative flex justify-center\\\">\\n                  <div\\n                    ref={mantleSlotRef}\\n                    className=\\\"w-[300px] sm:w-[320px] h-[635px] shrink-0\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* PART 2: Exact \\\"VLESS \320\277\321\200\320\276\321\202\320\270\320\262 Mantle\\\" Benchmark Comparison (scrolls normally after step 03!) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 sm:px-6 pb-24 lg:pb-32 pt-8\\\">\\n          <motion.div\\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 28 }}\\n            whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n            viewport={{ once: false, margin: \'-60px\' }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n          >\\n            <SpotlightShell\\n              className=\\\"border-[#2A2A2A] hover:border-[#FDE047]/35\\\"\\n              innerClassName=\\\"p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 bg-[#161616]\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"max-w-2xl\\\">\\n                <h3\\n                  style={{ fontSize: \'clamp(1.85rem, 3.5vw, 3rem)\' }}\\n                  className=\\\"font-bold tracking-tight text-[#FAFAFA] leading-[1.1]\\\"\\n                >\\n                  VLESS \320\277\321\200\320\276\321\202\320\270\320\262 <span className=\\\"text-[#FDE047]\\\">Mantle</span>\\n                </h3>\\n                <p className=\\\"mt-2.5 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#A1A1AA]\\\">\\n                  Anke \320\270 Happ \320\275\320\260 \320\276\320\264\320\270\320\275\320\260\320\272\320\276\320\262\320\276\320\271 \320\275\320\260\320\263\321\200\321\203\320\267\320\272\320\265: \321\207\320\265\320\274 \320\272\320\276\321\200\320\276\321\207\320\265 \320\277\320\276\320\273\320\276\321\201\320\272\320\260, \321\202\320\265\320\274 \320\273\321\203\321\207\321\210\320\265\\n                </p>\\n\\n                <div className=\\\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-[#FAFAFA]\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"h-3 w-7 rounded-full bg-[#FDE047]\\\" />\\n                    <span>Anke \302\267 Mantle</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"h-3 w-7 rounded-full bg-[#52555E]\\\" />\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-[#A1A1AA]\\\">Happ \302\267 VLESS</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"hidden md:grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mt-10 pb-3 border-b border-[#2A2A2A] text-sm font-semibold text-[#A1A1AA]\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"md:col-span-4\\\" />\\n                <div className=\\\"md:col-span-4\\\">iPhone</div>\\n                <div className=\\\"md:col-span-4\\\">Android</div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"divide-y divide-[#2A2A2A]\\\">\\n                {MANTLE_BENCHMARKS.map((row, idx) => (\\n                  <div\\n                    key={row.id}\\n                    className=\\\"py-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-center\\\"\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"md:col-span-4\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-[#FAFAFA]\\\">\\n                        {row.metric}\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div className=\\\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#8E8E93] mt-0.5\\\">\\n                        {row.subtitle}\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div className=\\\"md:col-span-4\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between md:block mb-2\\\">\\n                        <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-[#8E8E93] md:hidden\\\">\\n                          iPhone\\n                        </span>\\n                        <span className=\\\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#FDE047] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                          {row.iphone.label}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-transparent overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                          <motion.div\\n                            initial={{ width: 0 }}\\n                            whileInView={{ width: `${row.iphone.mantlePercent}%` }}\\n                            viewport={{ once: false, margin: \'-40px\' }}\\n                            transition={{\\n                              duration: 0.75,\\n                              delay: idx * 0.08,\\n                              ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1],\\n                            }}\\n                            className=\\\"h-full min-w-[12px] rounded-full bg-[#FDE047] shadow-[0_0_16px_rgba(253,224,71,0.35)]\\\"\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-transparent overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                          <motion.div\\n                            initial={{ width: 0 }}\\n                            whileInView={{ width: `${row.iphone.vlessPercent}%` }}\\n                            viewport={{ once: false, margin: \'-40px\' }}\\n                            transition={{\\n                              duration: 0.85,\\n                              delay: idx * 0.08 + 0.05,\\n                              ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1],\\n                            }}\\n                            className=\\\"h-full rounded-full bg-[#4A4D55]\\\"\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    <div className=\\\"md:col-span-4\\\">\\n                      <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between md:block mb-2\\\">\\n                        <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-[#8E8E93] md:hidden\\\">\\n                          Android\\n                        </span>\\n                        <span className=\\\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-[#FDE047] tabular-nums\\\">\\n                          {row.android.label}\\n                        </span>\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div className=\\\"space-y-2\\\">\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-transparent overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                          <motion.div\\n                            initial={{ width: 0 }}\\n                            whileInView={{ width: `${row.android.mantlePercent}%` }}\\n                            viewport={{ once: false, margin: \'-40px\' }}\\n                            transition={{\\n                              duration: 0.75,\\n                              delay: idx * 0.08 + 0.1,\\n                              ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1],\\n                            }}\\n                            className=\\\"h-full min-w-[12px] rounded-full bg-[#FDE047] shadow-[0_0_16px_rgba(253,224,71,0.35)]\\\"\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"h-3 w-full rounded-full bg-transparent overflow-hidden\\\">\\n                          <motion.div\\n                            initial={{ width: 0 }}\\n                            whileInView={{ width: `${row.android.vlessPercent}%` }}\\n                            viewport={{ once: false, margin: \'-40px\' }}\\n                            transition={{\\n                              duration: 0.85,\\n                              delay: idx * 0.08 + 0.15,\\n                              ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1],\\n                            }}\\n                            className=\\\"h-full rounded-full bg-[#4A4D55]\\\"\\n                          />\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                  </div>\\n                ))}\\n              </div>\",\"StartLine\":360,\"TargetContent\":\"            {/* Right Column: Hero Launch Anchor Slot for the Single 3D iPhone */}\\n            <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-5 xl:col-span-4 relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end\\\">\\n              {/* Parabolic Trajectory Hint Arc (visible as phone starts flying) */}\\n              <svg\\n                aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                viewBox=\\\"0 0 320 635\\\"\\n                className=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute w-[300px] sm:w-[320px] h-[635px] opacity-25\\\"\\n              >\\n                <rect\\n                  x=\\\"8\\\"\\n                  y=\\\"8\\\"\\n                  width=\\\"304\\\"\\n                  height=\\\"619\\\"\\n                  rx=\\\"48\\\"\\n                  fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                  stroke=\\\"#FDE047\\\"\\n                  strokeWidth=\\\"1\\\"\\n                  strokeDasharray=\\\"6 6\\\"\\n                  style={{ opacity: flightProgress > 0.05 ? 0.5 : 0 }}\\n                />\\n              </svg>\\n\\n              {/* Exact Bounding Box Anchor for Hero iPhone Start Position */}\\n              <div\\n                ref={heroSlotRef}\\n                className=\\\"w-[300px] sm:w-[320px] h-[635px] shrink-0\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      {/* =====================================================================\\n          SECTION 2: PLATFORMS (\\\"\320\224\320\276\321\201\321\202\321\203\320\277\320\275\320\276 \320\275\320\260 \320\262\321\201\320\265\321\205 \321\203\321\201\321\202\321\200\320\276\320\271\321\201\321\202\320\262\320\260\321\205\\\") \342\200\224 z-30!\\n          The z-20 3D iPhone physically passes UNDERNEATH this section!\\n         ===================================================================== */}\\n      <PlatformCards />\\n\\n      {/* =====================================================================\\n          SECTION 3: MANTLE CORE STICKY PIN TRACK & BENCHMARKS (z-10)\\n         ===================================================================== */}\\n      <section id=\\\"mantle\\\" className=\\\"relative z-10 border-b border-[#2A2A2A]\\\">\\n        {/* Tall Sticky Track (320vh) \342\200\224 locks scroll while stepping through 01, 02, 03 */}\\n        <div ref={mantleTrackRef} className=\\\"relative h-[320vh]\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"sticky top-[64px] min-h-[calc(100dvh-64px)] flex items-center py-10 overflow-hidden\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1200px] px-4 sm:px-6\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-center\\\">\\n                {/* Left Column: Header + Pinned Scroll Progress + Steps 01, 02, 03 */}\\n                <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-6\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"mb-8\\\">\\n                    <h2\\n                      style={{ fontSize: \'clamp(2rem, 3.8vw, 3.25rem)\' }}\\n                      className=\\\"font-bold tracking-tight text-[#FAFAFA] leading-[1.08]\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      Mantle \342\200\224 \321\217\320\264\321\200\320\276 <span className=\\\"text-[#FDE047]\\\">Anke</span>\\n                    </h2>\\n                    <p className=\\\"mt-2.5 text-base sm:text-lg text-[#A1A1AA]\\\">\\n                      \320\235\320\265 VLESS \320\270 \320\275\320\265 \320\263\320\276\321\202\320\276\320\262\320\260\321\217 \321\201\320\261\320\276\321\200\320\272\320\260 \342\200\224 \321\201\320\262\320\276\321\221 \321\217\320\264\321\200\320\276, \320\275\320\260\320\277\320\270\321\201\320\260\320\275\320\275\320\276\320\265 \321\201 \320\275\321\203\320\273\321\217\\n                    </p>\\n                  </div>\\n\\n                  {/* Steps List with Continuous Scroll Progress Bar */}\\n                  <div className=\\\"relative pl-5 space-y-3.5\\\">\\n                    {/* Vertical Track Line */}\\n                    <div\\n                      aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                      className=\\\"absolute left-0 top-2 bottom-2 w-1 rounded-full bg-[#2A2A2A] overflow-hidden\\\"\\n                    >\\n                      <div\\n                        style={{ height: `${Math.round(pinProgress * 100)}%` }}\\n                        className=\\\"w-full bg-[#FDE047] shadow-[0_0_12px_#FDE047] transition-all duration-75\\\"\\n                      />\\n                    </div>\\n\\n                    {steps.map((step, idx) => {\\n                      const isActive = activeStepIndex === idx;\\n                      return (\\n                        <button\\n                          key={step.tab}\\n                          type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                          onClick={() => handleJumpToStep(idx, step.tab)}\\n                          className=\\\"w-full text-left cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-[#FDE047]\\\"\\n                        >\\n                          <SpotlightShell\\n                            className={`transition-all duration-300 ${\\n                              isActive\\n                                ? \'border-[#FDE047] shadow-[0_0_35px_rgba(253,224,71,0.12)] translate-x-1\'\\n                                : \'opacity-60 hover:opacity-90 hover:border-[#FAFAFA]/25\'\\n                            }`}\\n                            innerClassName={`p-5 sm:p-6 transition-colors ${\\n                              isActive\\n                                ? \'bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FDE047]/[0.08] to-transparent\'\\n                                : \'\'\\n                            }`}\\n                          >\\n                            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3\\\">\\n                              <h3\\n                                className={`text-base sm:text-lg font-bold tracking-tight transition-colors ${\\n                                  isActive ? \'text-[#FDE047]\' : \'text-[#FAFAFA]\'\\n                                }`}\\n                              >\\n                                {step.title}\\n                              </h3>\\n                              <span\\n                                className={`text-xs font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md ${\\n                                  isActive\\n                                    ? \'bg-[#FDE047] text-black font-bold\'\\n                                    : \'bg-[#222226] text-[#A1A1AA]\'\\n                                }`}\\n                              >\\n                                {step.num} / 03\\n                              </span>\\n                            </div>\\n                            <p className=\\\"mt-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#A1A1AA] leading-relaxed\\\">\\n                              {step.desc}\\n                            </p>\\n                          </SpotlightShell>\\n                        </button>\\n                      );\\n                    })}\\n                  </div>\\n                </div>\\n\\n                {/* Right Column: Mantle Landing Anchor Slot for the Single 3D iPhone */}\\n                <div className=\\\"lg:col-span-6 relative flex justify-center\\\">\\n                  {/* Subtle Landing Dock Ring */}\\n                  <div\\n                    aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n                    className={`pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-auto w-[308px] sm:w-[328px] h-[643px] rounded-[56px] border border-dashed transition-opacity duration-500 ${\\n                      flightProgress < 0.98\\n                        ? \'border-[#FDE047]/35 opacity-60\'\\n                        : \'border-transparent opacity-0\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  />\\n\\n                  <div\\n                    ref={mantleSlotRef}\\n                    className=\\\"w-[300px] sm:w-[320px] h-[635px] shrink-0\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* PART 2: Exact \\\"VLESS \320\277\321\200\320\276\321\202\320\270\320\262 Mantle\\\" Benchmark Comparison (scrolls normally after step 03!) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 sm:px-6 pb-24 lg:pb-32 pt-8\\\">\\n          <motion.div\\n            initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 28 }}\\n            whileInView={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}\\n            viewport={{ once: true, margin: \'-60px\' }}\\n            transition={{ duration: 0.6, ease: [0.16, 1, 0.3, 1] }}\\n          >\\n            <SpotlightShell\\n              className=\\\"border-[#2A2A2A] hover:border-[#FDE047]/35\\\"\\n              innerClassName=\\\"p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 bg-[#161616]\\\"\\n            >\\n              <div className=\\\"max-w-2xl\\\">\\n                <h3\\n                  style={{ fontSize: \'clamp(1.85rem, 3.